    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nExceptional quality 4 Bedroom Detached Residence with gardens front and rear, in excellent condition and located in a sought after Bantry residential area. \n\nThis impressive, detached family home extends to approximately 163.5 sq. m. (1,760 sq.ft.) and occupies a beautifully landscaped site. Combining generous proportions, a practical family layout and superb outdoor space, the property has been exceptionally well maintained both inside and out.\n\nA welcoming entrance hall sets the tone, leading to a spacious sitting room with feature fireplace. To the rear of the property, the bright open-plan kitchen / dining room forms the heart of the home, offering an abundance of natural light and direct access to the rear patio and garden. A separate utility room provides additional storage, whilst a guest W.C. and a versatile study / playroom complete the ground floor accommodation. \n\nThe first floor comprises four generously proportioned bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in storage. The principal bedroom is ensuite and the second bedroom also benefits from its own ensuite shower room. A spacious family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms, making the layout perfectly suited to modern family living.\n\nOutside, the property is equally impressive. To the front, an expansive cobble-lock driveway provides excellent off-street parking. The private rear garden has been thoughtfully landscaped to provide a low-maintenance yet highly functional outdoor space. A large paved patio is ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining. Steps lead to an elevated garden featuring raised vegetable beds and a detached garden shed. \n\nBantry is one of West Cork's most vibrant and picturesque harbour towns, renowned for its stunning coastal setting, excellent range of shops, cafés, restaurants and supermarkets, together with schools, sporting facilities and healthcare services. The surrounding area offers exceptional sailing, golfing, walking and access to some of Ireland's most spectacular scenery along the Wild Atlantic Way. This superb home enjoys the perfect balance of peaceful residential living while remaining within easy reach of all the amenities Bantry has to offer.\n\nServices: Main town services, oil fired central heating and broadband.\n\nDisclaimer:Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, all information is provided in good faith and is believed to be correct, but is not guaranteed. Interested parties should satisfy themselves as to the accuracy and completeness of all details by independent inspection or enquiry. No representation or warranty is made regarding the condition, measurements, boundaries, planning status, services or other information relating to the property. All measurements, maps, photographs and distances are approximate and for guidance purposes only. Photographs, video and drone imagery are provided for illustrative purposes and may include features, furnishings or items not included in the sale."
      },
